{"ts":"2026-08-16T10:51:42.915Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"736bc2ce37b57aa429143ced","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-f6zjpq+pm-suhxny","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-f6zjpq","claim:pm-suhxny","lineage:pm-f6zjpq","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.233","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-16T10:51:42.915Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-16T10:51:42.915Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Evidence. Measurement: package.json declares 12 code exports (entries with a types path); sdk/public-surface.json governed 10. Ungoverned: the root '.' and './cli'. dist/cli/main.d.ts declares runPmCli and _testOnly, an object of 86 internal helpers; a bun install of the published 2026.8.16 artifact and an import of @unbrained/pm-cli/cli returns both at runtime, so the leak is in the shipped package and not only in the working tree.\n\nNegative control before: adding a new ./negative-control export to package.json left sdk-surface-snapshot --check, audit-package-boundary and package-sdk-contract-parity all passing, with the snapshot reporting '0 classified changes'.\n\nFix: listPublishedCodeExports derives the denominator from package.json exports and findUnclassifiedPackageCodeExports reports any that carry no classification; buildSdkSurfaceSnapshot refuses while the list is non-empty. '.' is classified aggregate_alias with ENTRYPOINT_ALIASES asserting its types path still equals ./sdk's, and its symbols are not duplicated (snapshot grew 6.7 KB, not 600 KB). './cli' is classified executable_entry and its two symbols are recorded, so the 86-helper signature is now signed contract data and any change to it is a classified surface change.\n\nNegative control after: the same injected export fails with 'Package export map publishes unclassified code entrypoints: ./negative-control', exit 1. Removing it restores the pass.\n\nVerification: tests/unit/scripts/sdk-surface-snapshot.spec.ts 17/17 pass, including a test that asserts the real repository export map is fully classified and that the snapshot's entrypoint set equals listPublishedCodeExports(package.json). Full suite passed. pnpm quality:static passed.\n\nThe separate question of whether ./cli should publish _testOnly at all is deliberately not answered here; pm-rf120g owns it."}]}],"before_hash":"0edd36f336835eef3c7b0bfddf36d7ccd51a4b832b50915cbf8fe9a6e0f33c73","after_hash":"3296d35755d3141bd0ff9f19686229d43132f0d2b7a16ed29085db5f5cfaf7fa","item_hash_version":2}
